            <description><![CDATA[
                <h2>Conduct 1.0.0</h2>
                <p>The first public release - a lightweight menu bar conductor for your media keys.</p>
                <ul>
                    <li>Route media keys to your preferred music app, with smart Auto mode detection</li>
                    <li>9 supported players plus YouTube browser control across 13 browsers</li>
                    <li>Volume key redirection, double-tap skip, and a global app-cycle hotkey</li>
                    <li>Settings window that sizes to each tab with a rock-solid nav bar and a smooth sliding selection indicator</li>
                    <li>Auto Priority and Detection with live drag-reordering</li>
                    <li>Launch at login, an onboarding tour, and built-in auto-updates</li>
                    <li>Localized in English and German</li>
                </ul>
            ]]></description>
